00:28:37.409 --> 00:28:40.909
you are doing something. Do you have a solution for me?" And

00:28:40.929 --> 00:28:46.529
I was like actually. And since we launched the website, it's

00:28:46.549 --> 00:28:50.269
been a combination of like word of mouth and now playing

00:28:50.289 --> 00:28:54.189
around with cost per click. And we are in a lucky position

00:28:54.209 --> 00:28:59.339
