00:30:07.319 --> 00:30:10.069
So probably just from a consumer product stand point of view

00:30:10.069 --> 00:30:11.819
and sharing consumer products for eCommerce, customer

00:30:11.819 --> 00:30:14.569
acquisition is very tricky and it's something you need to be

